SEC. 47. Closing of Polls; Counting of Votes and Transmission of Results; Printing of Reports, VVPAT Audit, and Shutting Down the ACMs; Procedure. - After the voters have cast their ballots, the EB shall ensure that the IP-SVR, PDL-SPP, and PPP ballots, if any, have been fed in the ACM. The EB shall then close the voting by performing the procedures provided in the ACM OPERATION PROCEDURES ("ANNEX B").

